@startuml learning_runtime
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Frozen MLP episode - supported Burn accumulation
start
:Bind frozen model, baseline and validated F64 device;
while (Another trusted ACKed decision?) is (yes)
  :Compute finite selected log probability through Burn;
  :Differentiate negative log probability on unchanged model;
  :Accumulate and finite-check Burn parameter gradients;
  :Release candidate tensors / backward graph;
endwhile (no)
if (Verified eligible completion with samples?) then (yes)
  :Scale accumulated gradient by frozen advantage;
  :Differentiate L2 once through Burn;
  :Combine through Burn and propose one SGD step;
  :Finite-check complete proposal before atomic commit;
else (no)
  :Discard buffers without PG / L2 / baseline insertion;
endif
note right
  C7: 2,335 coordinates per active/inactive fixture.
  eps=1e-6; atol=1e-8; rtol=1e-5.
  No claim of all-parameter coverage or training authorization.
end note
stop
@enduml
